# "Save slots" — the save manager's subroutines, driven by a few lines of its
# own: list, save slot 3, list, load it back, erase it, list.
#
# The harness boots with an all-zero NVRAM, so every slot starts free.

expect ^ 16 SLOTS FREE\s*\r?\nSAVED SLOT 3 AS ID 42
expect ^SLOT 3: ID 42$
expect ^ 15 SLOTS FREE\s*$
expect ^LOADED SLOT 3, LAST BYTE 169\s*$
expect ^ERASED SLOT 3\r?\n 16 SLOTS FREE\s*$
absent ^SLOT +\d+: DAMAGED
